1.6">To start a return, you can contact us at <b>hello@phoenixwaterfilters.co.uk</b>. If your return is accepted, we will give you the instructions on how and where to send your package. Items sent back to us without first requesting a return will not be accepted.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div> <div class="ecom-column ecom-core ecom-7jh1t8ko9nt"><div class="core__column--wrapper"><div class="ecom-column__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div><div class="core__blocks" index="1"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-077eyq0bylg" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom-element ecom-base-image" deep="1"><figure><div class="ecom-container-image ecom-image-align" data-stopdrag=""><div data-stopdrag="" class="ecom-image-content-position ecom-image-default ecom-base-image-container-overlay" style=""><picture class="ecom-image-picture"><img loading="lazy" fetchpriority="low" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/1821/9557/files/money_back_guarantee.webp?v=1749206951" alt="money_back_guarantee" width="1281" height="1821"></picture></div></div></figure></div></div> </div></div></div></div> </div><div class="ecom-section__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div> </section><section class="ecom-row ecom-core ecom-section ecom-iaqf0f3uo6r" data-id="ecom-iaqf0f3uo6r" style="z-index: inherit;"><div data-deep="1" class="core__row--columns"><div class="ecom-column ecom-core ecom-y2kqf74voza"><div class="core__column--wrapper"><div class="ecom-column__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div><div class="core__blocks" index="0"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-7r1lng6wjij" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html" data-stopdrag="true" deep="1"><h3 class="ecom__heading ecom-db">{{ 'sections.ecom-the-phoenix-gravity-system-new-product.headingtext_7r1lng6wjij_html' | t }